#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>また、いつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ…ため息しか出てこない。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Makes me feel kinda sick to my stomach."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで見られていると思うと、
#. 気分が悪いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hate the idea that someone might be watching me\n"
"right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>校則によると、監視カメラを壊したらマズイんだよな…
#. ムカツクけど、放っておくしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We're not allowed to mess with the cameras, so I'd\n"
"better make sure I don't touch it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうやったら外れるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How am I supposed to get this thing off?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外れないのか？　ウソだろ？
#. 信じないぞ。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Does it really not come off? Seriously? I just can't\n"
"believe this..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうやったら外れるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How am I supposed to get this thing off?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 外れないのか？　ウソだろ？
#. 信じないぞ。
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Does it really not come off? Seriously? I just can't\n"
"believe this..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>初日に、ボクが突っ伏していた机…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the desk I woke up on when I first got here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>机の上には、あの安っぽいパンフレットが
#. 置きっぱなしになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The little pamphlet is still laying there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、読む気はしない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have absolutely no desire to look at it ever again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間なんか気にしても仕方がないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There really isn't much reason to worry about what\n"
"time it is.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今のボクらには…
#. 昼も夜もあんまり関係ないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Night and day don't mean much to me right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
